                <invention-title lang="fr">BOÎTIERS DE COMMANDE ET CARTES DE CIRCUIT DE SYSTÈME SUR MODULE POUR VÉHICULES SANS PILOTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CONTROL BOXES AND SYSTEM-ON-MODULE CIRCUIT BOARDS FOR UNMANNED VEHICLES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A control box 100 includes a housing 110 defining an interior 112, a circuit board 120 disposed within the interior 112, and an input/output connector 126 extending from the housing 110. The control box 100 further includes a heat sink 118 removably connected to the housing 110 such that the circuit board 120 is positioned between the housing 110 and the heat sink 118. The circuit board 120 is in contact with the heat sink 118.</p>
            </abstract>
